# 90-Day Business School
#
# This app currently runs entirely client-side with no database and no
# external services: all progress, journal entries, and the Business Model
# Canvas are persisted in the browser's localStorage. No environment
# variables are required to run it locally or deploy it.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder for future server-side features
# (e.g. a database connection string or auth provider keys) so the project
# has a documented place to add them without guessing variable names.
